  "description": {
    "text": "The third Pokémon Card Display Set Gift Box (宝可梦卡牌展示套礼盒) came out on 26 October 2024. Each box held one random special-art holo card, one of 13, with a silicone display case for that card's Pokémon, a card sleeve, a clear card film and a random 25-card Shadow of the Blue Sea pack. Twelve cards, numbered out of 12, each show a Pokémon with a trainer: Parasect, Roserade, Chandelure, Milotic, Gengar, Jynx, Gardevoir, Hisuian Arcanine, Mightyena, Snorlax, Smeargle and Altaria. One hidden card was made for every 47 regular ones, a Braixen numbered 013, and it came with a Braixen display case. Pokémon China said Milotic, Jynx, Gardevoir and Smeargle would also appear in later products.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Charizard VSTAR and Mewtwo VSTAR boxes and the third display set gift box (9 October 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15683.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSUC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 012",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Charizard VSTAR and Mewtwo VSTAR boxes and the third display set gift box (9 October 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15683.html"
      }
    ]
  },
